## Gfx::FontData (Libraries/LibGfx/Font/FontData.h:14). Edited by region r09: the C++
## `Variant<ByteBuffer, NonnullRefPtr<Core::Resource const>> m_data` is two fields, because
## bytes() answers a span into the ByteBuffer held here, which a payload enum cannot give (its
